message.content:
先進入 `Quarter1_Reports` 資料夾，列出裡面的檔案，接著在上一層建立新的資料夾，再把所有文字檔複製過去。

```json
{
  "commentary": [
    {
      "function": "cd",
      "arguments": {"folder": "Quarter1_Reports"}
    },
    {
      "function": "ls",
      "arguments": {"a": true}
    },
    {
      "function": "cd",
      "arguments": {"folder": ".."}
    },
    {
      "function": "mkdir",
      "arguments": {"dir_name": "Archived_Quarter1"}
    },
    {
      "function": "cd",
      "arguments": {"folder": "Quarter1_Reports"}
    }
  ]
}
```

現在請你告訴我這個資料夾裡面有哪些以 `.txt` 為副檔名的檔案，我會幫你一次性複製到 `Archived_Quarter1` 裡。
